## Why This Is Asked
Observability and data quality are foundational for reliable analytics. This question probes practical patterns a junior engineer can implement end-to-end, including validation, DLQ routing, metrics, and watermarking.

## Key Concepts
- Schema validation at ingestion
- Dead-letter queue for bad data
- Per-field quality metrics
- Watermarks and late data handling
- Lightweight testing with synthetic data

## Code Example
```javascript
function validateEvent(e) {
  if (!e) return false;
  const fields = ['user_id','event_type','ts','event_id'];
  for (const f of fields) if (!(f in e)) return false;
  const ts = Number(new Date(e.ts));
  if (Number.isNaN(ts) || ts < 0) return false;
  return true;
}
```

