- How would you test offline support and cache eviction?
- How would you handle multi-device sync for the same user?

## Why This Is Asked
This angle tests practical edge compute handling: budget-aware routing, deterministic fallbacks, and testability in real apps.

## Key Concepts
- Budget-aware orchestration: enforce per-request time budgets for compute paths
- Deterministic fallback: seed heuristic with user_id_masked and client_timestamp for reproducibility
- Telemetry: track latency, fallback usage, and model_version for auditing
- Testability: budget-bound tests, fairness across devices, end-to-end reproducibility

## Code Example
```javascript
function selectScore(input){
  const {budgetMs, start}=input;
  const canRunModel = simulateModelCost(input) <= budgetMs;
  if(!canRunModel){
    return heuristicScore(input.user_id_masked, input.client_timestamp);
  }
  return modelScore(input);
}
```

